{"id":"658773","name":"牛肉士豆烧胡萝卜","author":"美食家3998N_bkoa","authorId":"13061039","desc":"","cover":"images/658773/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"熟牛肉","amount":"适量一"},{"name":"土豆","amount":"100克"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"半根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"土豆洗净去皮切成小块。","img":"images/658773/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"胡萝卜及青萝卜切成小块备用。","img":"images/658773/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"半个白菜切成四半。","img":"images/658773/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"白菜叶子切成两半。","img":"images/658773/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅里水烧开下入土豆及萝卜块。","img":"images/658773/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入熟牛肉下入白菜叶子。","img":"images/658773/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒均匀炖十分钟收汤汁出锅。","img":"images/658773/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/658773/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}